{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WTC : Recruitment Day is a very short side-story comedy/drama interactive visual novel, based on the main &quot;Welcome To... Chichester&quot; series, and set in a semi-fictional world of secret organisations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is self-contained, and so reading other episodes is not a requirement to enjoy this game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916660/extras/story.png?t=1741815615\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After Grendel Jinx is mugged, she chases after the thief, determined to retrieve her possessions - and also recruit the person responsible.  For once, Grendel's lack of attention to security protocols at &quot;The Council Of The Unseen&quot; may have prevented further problems. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916660/extras/features.png?t=1741815615\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Grendel Jinx is voiced by &quot;Sarah&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Two different endings </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Short, two chapter story (approx. around 30 minutes to complete) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The '<i>Self-Expanding Frying Pan</i>' is back ! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spanish translation by Daynel Chavez (@imqu4d)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Japanese translation by\u00a0Translator GORO=chan (@gorochantransl1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rating : Off-screen violence.  Some adult dialogue </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916660/extras/characters.png?t=1741815615\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916660/extras/c1.png?t=1741815615\" />Grendel Jinx and her mother.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1916660/extras/c2.png?t=1741815615\" />Lorinda Ella and The Boss</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Name","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/6e2d439b4e9b1fbdb92098511c392b5d691d8435.jpg"},{"name":"New Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/ec116ce168938f15d5ed551841fa8e6c9de10589.jpg"},{"name":"Male Protagonist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/95d53a710b526f3a9c35f31e454cab2f9f834d53.jpg"},{"name":"Female Protagonist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/38c28a8200ae6f7a3be70e565d3ed959b27f76aa.jpg"},{"name":"Speed Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/fe17f1502243a934fab28725c7d63feca8c0be80.jpg"},{"name":"Find Ending #1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/39e01dd30c42bfb190f78c889c3d519c68ccf39a.jpg"},{"name":"Find Ending #2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/32ae9a6f19a9e829078183a4c4db5fe590ef7f4f.jpg"},{"name":"Short Introduction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/557c281c9ff65a71a8feff6db2ad2ec9014ce7fe.jpg"},{"name":"Long Introduction","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/16a2a1d818691c215805b94956900fa8e95baac8.jpg"},{"name":"Had Enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1916660/4e349445eacffb1a545e9098ce8158484ea46409.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai